00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.970
Ya, orang-orang memposting apa pun di sana.

208
00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.100
Mereka mengganggu kehidupan pribadi Anda,

209
00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.470
atau orientasi Anda, hal-hal seperti itu.

210
00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.150
Hai.

211
00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.050
Hai.

